{"id":"n14920-1-8","stage":3,"title":"되찾다 · 找回","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14920-1-8-1","ko":"어? 이 가방 너희 언니가 가져갔다고 하지 않았어?","zh":"咦？不是说这个包是你们的姐姐拿走了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어?","meaning":"咦","explanation":"어：咦","readings":[{"term":"어","audio":"/audio/228794e2524374dc8637.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26153","senseId":"1","lemma":"어","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가방","meaning":"包，背包，提包","explanation":"가방：包，背包，提包","readings":[{"term":"가방","audio":"/audio/6852b2954fc8556674f1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18259","senseId":"1","lemma":"가방","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"너희","meaning":"你们","explanation":"너희：你们","readings":[{"term":"너희","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61180","senseId":"1","lemma":"너희","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"언니가","meaning":"姐姐","explanation":"언니：姐姐；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"언니","audio":"/audio/9ab740751e1be982fcd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31971","senseId":"1","lemma":"언니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가져갔다고","meaning":"带走，拿走","explanation":"가져가다：带走，拿走；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다고：转述陈述句的内容：“说、听说……”。","readings":[{"term":"가져가다","audio":"/audio/d96cfec150bdc38f4c11.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"53811","senseId":"1","lemma":"가져가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하지","meaning":"表示引用。","explanation":"하다：表示引用。；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"22","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"않았어?","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71581","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"228794e2524374dc","term":"어","zh":"咦","audio":"/audio/228794e2524374dc8637.mp3","entryId":"26153","definition":"感到惊讶、慌张、焦急、急促时发出的声音。","pronunciation":["어"]},{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"6852b2954fc85566","term":"가방","zh":"包，背包，提包","audio":"/audio/6852b2954fc8556674f1.mp3","entryId":"18259","definition":"用来放入物品且可以手提或肩背的东西。","pronunciation":["가방"]},{"id":"ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba","term":"너희","zh":"你们","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3","entryId":"61180","definition":"指代多个听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너히"]},{"id":"9ab740751e1be982","term":"언니","zh":"姐姐","audio":"/audio/9ab740751e1be982fcd7.mp3","entryId":"31971","definition":"女子用于指称或称呼兄弟姐妹或亲戚兄弟姐妹中比自己年长的女性。","pronunciation":["언니"]},{"id":"d96cfec150bdc38f","term":"가져가다","zh":"带走，拿走","audio":"/audio/d96cfec150bdc38f4c11.mp3","entryId":"53811","definition":"把某个东西从一个地方搬去另一个地方。","pronunciation":["가저가다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示引用。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示引用。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"71581","definition":"用于否定前文所指的行为。","pronunciation":["안타"]}],"audio":"/audio/3c773996cd9855212ae0.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14920-1-8-2","ko":"언니 집에 가서 되찾아 왔지.","zh":"我去姐姐家把包拿回来了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"언니","meaning":"姐姐","explanation":"언니：姐姐","readings":[{"term":"언니","audio":"/audio/9ab740751e1be982fcd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31971","senseId":"1","lemma":"언니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"집에","meaning":"家","explanation":"집：家；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"3","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가서","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"14","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"되찾아","meaning":"找回，收复","explanation":"되찾다：找回，收复；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"되찾다","audio":"/audio/d3edd3e3958232ee7175.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14920","senseId":"1","lemma":"되찾다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왔지.","meaning":"来","explanation":"오다：来；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"23","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"9ab740751e1be982","term":"언니","zh":"姐姐","audio":"/audio/9ab740751e1be982fcd7.mp3","entryId":"31971","definition":"女子用于指称或称呼兄弟姐妹或亲戚兄弟姐妹中比自己年长的女性。","pronunciation":["언니"]},{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"组成家庭而生活的一家子。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为做某事而向别的地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"d3edd3e3958232ee","term":"되찾다","zh":"找回，收复","audio":"/audio/d3edd3e3958232ee7175.mp3","entryId":"14920","definition":"重新找回丢失的、忘却的或消失的东西。","pronunciation":["되찯따","뒈찯따"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"为了某个目的或事情而从别的地方移动到这里。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e739dcc43ae5f223841b.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.957,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=14920","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-s